  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……おや\r\n今その感想を？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040060070",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "101",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやー……ははは……\r\n恥ずかしながら、鈍感で……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんなの仕事、季節を先取りすることも多いだろ？\r\n今何月なのかわかんなくなってくるんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "秋は特に体感短いし、\r\nハッとさせられることが多いよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もう秋か！　って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……\r\n確かに、夏がまだ名残惜しげにしている日も多いからね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "かと思えば、冬は足早にやってくるし",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうそう！\r\nだからつい、秋あったっけ……ってなりがちなんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "紅葉とか、あんなに綺麗だし──\r\nもったいないんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタは特に、ゆっくり景色を楽しむ時間も\r\n取りづらいだろうし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "時間のやりくりが下手な自覚は、まぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "というより、仕事のしすぎでは？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もっと咲耶みたいに、\r\n日々を豊かに過ごせるようになりたいんだけどなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ということで！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020080",
    "autoWaitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ここで発表なんだけど──\r\n実は、さっき買った駅弁……秋の味覚尽くしなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……あ、ああ……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "秋を感じたいな～って思ったからなんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こういうのも……ちょっとだけだけど、\r\n日々を豊かにすることに繋がらないかな？　ってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶的にはどう思う？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……いい策だと思うけれど\r\n私の意見でいいのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん\r\n俺のお手本は咲耶だからな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お墨付きももらったし、\r\n早く食べたくなってきた……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020130"
  },
  {
    "select": "こういうところで\r\n食べるのって",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "……帰りの分も\r\n考えないと……！",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "咲耶のお弁当は\r\n確か──",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わくわくしないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……わかるよ\r\n遠出の高揚感とあわさってね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、お出かけの象徴っていうか──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──うん？　どうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、失礼",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタのこと、\r\n目に入れても痛くないような気がしたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020160"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020170,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフッ、気が早いな",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "お昼の分すら待ち焦がれている状態だというのに、\r\nもう夜の心配を？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは、楽しくなっちゃって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──そうか\r\nそれじゃあ私も、今日はせっかちにいこうかな",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2006013020200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタの考えた秋を感じる策に\r\n私も乗りたいということさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601302/2006013020200"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
